{
 "description": "Extract an ACORD 25 certificate AND judge it against a requirement profile (inline or profileId), returning a signed Verdict with per-check results, flags, and a risk score (spec \u00a73.2). Use extract_coi instead if you only want the fields without a verdict; use check_carrier only when you have no certificate, since this tool already checks the carrier when your profile sets a carrier requirement.",
 "execution": {
  "taskSupport": "forbidden"
 },
